<section id="ii" class="ltx_subsection">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">§23.10(ii) </span>Duplication Formulas</h2>
<div id="ii.info" class="ltx_metadata ltx_info">
<span href="" class="ltx_infoicon ltx_icon" title="Show Annotations"><span class="ltx_font_bold">ⓘ</span></span>
<div class="ltx_infocontent">
<dl>
<dt>Keywords:</dt>
<dd>
<a class="ltx_keyword" href="./search/search?q=Weierstrass%20elliptic%20functions">Weierstrass elliptic functions</a>, <a class="ltx_keyword" href="./search/search?q=duplication%20formulas">duplication formulas</a>
</dd>
<dt>Notes:</dt>
<dd>For (<a href="./23.10#E7" title="(23.10.7) ‣ §23.10(ii) Duplication Formulas ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.7</span></a>), (<a href="./23.10#E9" title="(23.10.9) ‣ §23.10(ii) Duplication Formulas ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.9</span></a>),
(<a href="./23.10#E10" title="(23.10.10) ‣ §23.10(ii) Duplication Formulas ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.10</span></a>) let <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m48.png" altimg-height="13px" altimg-valign="-2px" altimg-width="59px" alttext="v\to u" display="inline"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></math> in
(<a href="./23.10#E1" title="(23.10.1) ‣ §23.10(i) Addition Theorems ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.1</span></a>)–(<a href="./23.10#E3" title="(23.10.3) ‣ §23.10(i) Addition Theorems ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.3</span></a>). For (<a href="./23.10#E8" title="(23.10.8) ‣ §23.10(ii) Duplication Formulas ‣ §23.10 Addition Theorems and Other Identities ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23.10.8</span></a>)
see <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet">Walker (<a href="./bib/W#bib2359" title="Elliptic Functions. A Constructive Approach" class="ltx_ref">1996</a>, p. 83)</cite>.</dd>
